{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20350","headline":"赠姚怤 · 张籍","name":"赠姚怤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漏天日无光，泽土松不长。\n君今职下位，志气安得扬。\n白发文思壮，才爲国贤良。\n无人识高韵，荐于天子傍。\n况我愚朴姿，强趋利名场。\n远同干贵人，身举固难彰。\n昔逢汴水滨，今会习池阳。\n岂无再来期，顾恐非此方。\n愿爲石中泉，不爲瓦上霜。\n离别勿复道，所贵不相忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}